          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#do-you-need-to-seal" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Does Your Stone Need Sealing?</a>
          <a href="#penetrating-vs-topical" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Penetrating vs Topical</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our Five Picks Reviewed</a>
          <a href="#by-stone" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. By Stone Type</a>
          <a href="#applying" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. How to Apply It</a>
          <a href="#maintenance" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Resealing and Maintenance</a>
          <a href="#common-mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Common Mistakes</a>
