            For most natural stone, <strong class="text-white">Miracle Sealants 511 Impregnator</strong> is the sealer to buy: invisible, durable, and equally at home on a limestone floor and a flagstone patio. Indoors where odour matters, <strong class="text-white">Black Diamond</strong> does the same job water-based and cheaper. Outdoors under real weather, <strong class="text-white">StoneTech BulletProof</strong> lasts longer, and <strong class="text-white">Ghostshield Siloxa-Tek 8510</strong> is the one to choose only if you genuinely want the wet look.
          </p>
