            Run the water test before buying anything, clean with pH-neutral products only, and wipe back every trace of excess within the window on the label. And keep the expectation honest: a sealer buys you minutes to wipe up a spill, not immunity — nothing on this page prevents an acidic splash from etching limestone or marble.
